      "side": 1,
      "message": "To support this in BufferManagers I think it not small change. I guess we need to add new field in caps for it, and make BufferManagers behavior differently base on it. I feel it is not easy to implement and test without a workable dawn backend. So my plan is to land enough code from exploration branch, so we can have a workable dawn backend, and then we can start fixing those kind of issues step by step easily. Otherwise, we have to continue working on the exploration branch (which already have a lot of changes and hacks). Maintaining and sharing code will become harder and harder. I imagine the final CLs will become difficult to review too.",
